  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Preview for Windows and .NET Framework 4.8.1. Adds root GetShortJobInfo, GetFullJobInfo and SetInputUnitsEx with standalone job models, checked BSTR outputs, culture-aware date parsing and validated native unit codes. Includes matching interface/concrete IntelliSense for 140 geometry, 66 load and 9 root methods, expanded root documentation and 99 executable XML examples. Retains GetLoadCases inclusive ID ranges and earlier identity, query, mutation and model-attachment work. Native named-model metadata/date conventions, unit switching and broader-version validation remain pending. Full release notes: https://github.com/structuraldeveloper/StaadPro.Interop/blob/main/docs/Release-Notes.md",
